  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx > y > z\n\n(z)/(x) = (9)/(16)\n\n(z)/(x) - y = 0.0625\n\nx + y + z = 2(3)/(12)\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nSum = x + y + z\n\n**Calculations:**\n\ny = (9)/(16) - 0.0625\n\n⇒ y = 0.5625 - 0.0625\n\n⇒ y = 0.5 = (1)/(2)\n\n⇒ x + y + z = 2 + (3)/(12) = 2 + (1)/(4) = (9)/(4)\n\n⇒ (x + z) + (1)/(2) = (9)/(4)\n\n⇒ x + z = (9)/(4) - (1)/(2)\n\n⇒ x + z = (9 - 2)/(4) = (7)/(4)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**",
